            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Production of a ventilation system for a school with schoolrooms and recreation room. The inventory is based on a building with a total heated gross floor area of 2849 m2 and a total nominal air flow of 13630 m3/h, total weight of the components: 3822 kg/Unit, building with a specific air flow rate of 4.8 m3/h per m2 heated gross floor area. Data from call of bid including components for air handling units, ducts including insulation, air valves, roof-hoods, dampers, fire dampers, silencers. The data represent a ductwork mainly made of galvanized steel and includes air handling units mainly with heat recovery. System with central and decentral air handling units. Building without ground heat exchanger.;
UUID: e1b60142-d8ce-38e9-a84f-55aed983f585</common:generalComment>
